// Consent component - explicit terms / GDPR consent checkbox.
// Distinct from a generic checkbox so consent semantics are explicit in stored results.
// Submitted/stored value is simply 'true'; consent metadata (timestamp, terms version) is out of scope (issue #158).
// The linked terms target MUST be readable by anonymous visitors (guest permissions),
// otherwise the link will 404 for non-authenticated users.
[fmdbext:consent] > jnt:content, fmdbmix:element, fmdbmix:validationMessages
 - statement (string, richtext) i18n indexed=no mandatory
 - termsTarget (weakreference) indexed=no < 'jnt:page', 'jnt:file'
 - termsLinkLabel (string) i18n indexed=no
 - required (boolean) = true autocreated
